<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58701" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλουρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλος, οὐρά</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dock-tailed, stump-tailed</i>, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ὑπὸ γήρως ἀπτῆνα καὶ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλουρις</span></b> , of the fox in the fable, <i><span class="en">
				Timocr.
				3
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοθοῦριν</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>truncated</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυραμίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Ar.</u>
					2.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλουροι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμαί</span>), αἱ,
			<i>colures</i>, two great circles passing through the equinoctial
			and solstitial points, intersecting at the poles, <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				1.11.17
			</span></i> (sg.), <i><span class="en">
				Theo Sm.
				p.132
			</span></i> H., etc.(in full 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κ. κύκλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gem.
					2.21
				</span></i>
			): sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a kind of
				<i>fig</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.75d
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
